^["intent"]{
 ~#goal: "Invalidate the LSP cache proportionally to the edit by keying granules on appositions authors already placed, fix the three confirmed cache defects that make granularity moot, and surface granule state through codeLens."
 ~#taste: "correctness, resolution, disclosure"
 ~#premise: "The apposition body is lexed raw to the matching paren, so a surface's whole apposition set is extractable without a parse — an ergonomic decision that is also a cheap validity probe."
}

